A. It is permitted to discharge a weapon within the city limits under the following conditions:
1. Law enforcement officers in the discharge of their official duties and the military at a funeral in honor of the deceased;
2. Those persons acting in defense of person or property and otherwise in conformity with state law;
3. Those persons in possession of a permit for turkey shoots, licensed firing ranges, and those performing in theatrical productions using blanks;
4. City or county animal control officers for the specific intended purpose of sedation and capture of animals; or
5. Those persons in possession of a pest control permit issued by the city for the specific intended purpose of sedation and capture of animals.
(Ord. 07-187 § 1 (part), 2007)
